	(text "FERA ports" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 12 0) (effects (font (size 4 4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "991a3229-5051-5653-8a99-2c5fc4daf358"))
	(text "Four identical FERA ports. XT30PW-F polarity per the Amass drawing: pad 1 = minus, pad 2 = plus\n(plus is the contact at the flat end of the housing). Rated 15 A continuous, 30 A momentary.\nSignal header pin order is a routing placeholder; the logical order is in docs/port-spec.md.\nPer port: TPS2069C switch (1.5 A, enable + fault to the MCU) for the module's 5 V, 100 ohm in series\nwith S1-S3 and ID, 1 k in the shared telemetry line, USBLC6-4 clamp on the contact side.\nPort 3.3 V comes from its own current-limited LDO (3V3P, sensors page)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7addacfc-d7a3-518d-ae8f-1d41bcc72301"))
